.TH RFID-CLEAR-CURRENT 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-clear-current \- clear local RFID mode, arm, and wait state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-clear-current
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rfid-clear-current
stops the current RFID mode process group, stops RFID arm/wait helper units or
processes, resets the mode-runner navigation state to root, clears the arm LCD
event, and writes an LCD event reading
.BR "RF QUEUE" /
.BR "CLEARED" .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RFID_MODE_CARD_ID
Optional current card identifier recorded in the clear event.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-mode-runner (1),
.BR rfid-arm-next-script (1)
